    "scale_anchor_mm": 120,
    "assembly_notes": "The hinge body-half assembly comprises a main member (u_bracket) with upper and lower parallel extensions and a mounting wall bolted to the vehicle body. A U-shaped link member is pivotally connected between those extensions by a vertical pintle pin aligned on the hinge axis. The door-half member carries a leaf flange whose pintle-pin hole also rides on the same pin, allowing lift-off by raising the door along the pintle axis."
  }
